OL,3,AThirteen dead as mine disaster
OL,4,Ahighlights illegal hunt for gold
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's been three days since Rani last
OL,7,Fsaw her father as he left for work on
OL,8,FMonday. Early on Tuesday, she received
OL,9,Fnews that he was trapped underground.
OL,11,FRais, 50, had been working as an
OL,12,Fillegal gold miner in Bogor,
OL,13,FIndonesia's West Java province. On
OL,14,FMonday night, he and 25 other miners
OL,15,Fwere digging in an open-pit mine about
OL,16,F100m (328ft) deep, when torrential rain
OL,17,Fcaused a nearby river to overflow and
OL,18,Fflood the two shafts.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
