OL,3,AThirteen dead as mine disaster
OL,4,Ahighlights illegal hunt for gold
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities on Thursday confirmed that
OL,7,F13 people had died and their bodies
OL,8,Fwere recovered from the site. At least
OL,9,F13 more are thought to still be
OL,10,Fmissing.
OL,12,FSearch-and-rescue operations are
OL,13,Fongoing, with personnel using ropes to
OL,14,Faccess the depths of the dark, narrow
OL,15,Fand slippery mine shafts, which are
OL,16,Fcontinually being flooded from below.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
